{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45802","headline":"经孟浩然鹿门旧居二首 二 · 贯休","name":"经孟浩然鹿门旧居二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"花落谷莺啼，精灵安在哉。\n青山不可问，永日独裴回。\n塚穴应藏虎，荒碑祗见苔。\n伊余亦惆怅，昨日郢城回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45802.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45802","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}